flowchart LR
    JMS[JMS-shaped Java 6 code] --> F[ModernConnectionFactory]
    JAX[JAX-WS endpoint] --> JAXB[JAXB XML/text boundary]
    JAXB --> F
    F --> C[ModernConnection]
    C --> JNI[JNI facade]
    JNI --> ROUTE[Rust routing + capability declarations]
    ROUTE --> K[Kafka]
    ROUTE --> R[RabbitMQ]
    ROUTE --> N[NATS / JetStream]
    ROUTE --> P[Pulsar]
    C --> M[JMX metrics MBean]
